DISCLAIMER
The software is provided "AS IS", without any warranty. The author is not liable for any damage or loss of data that may result from its use.
The texts about saints, feasts and historical events are written in our own words and show their verification state; they are not an official church or historical source.

CONTENT AND IMAGES
The images come from Wikimedia Commons and have a free licence (public domain, CC0 or CC BY). Every image shows its creator, its licence and the link to its source.
The data rest on public sources: the Megas Synaxaristis (synaxarion.gr) for the memories of the saints and the Greek Wikipedia (el.wikipedia.org) for names and years. Only the facts are taken from them; the texts of the app do not copy texts of other websites.

THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
The app uses the SixLabors.ImageSharp library (Six Labors Split License) to read WebP images.

